{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_management_progress_and_production_readiness_report_2026_10_29_document", "label": "Agriculture Is Life: Development, Improvements and Production Readiness Report", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/MANAGEMENT_PROGRESS_AND_PRODUCTION_READINESS_REPORT_2026-10-29.md", "source_location": "L1", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_management_progress_and_production_readiness_report_2026_10_29_implemented_verified_released_distinction", "label": "Implemented verified released distinction", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/MANAGEMENT_PROGRESS_AND_PRODUCTION_READINESS_REPORT_2026-10-29.md", "source_location": "L13", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The report uses three different meanings of completion: - **Implemented:** the change exists in the application or its supporting tools. - **Verified:** the stated behaviour was checked in the stated environment. A local test is not a production test."}, {"id": "docs_management_progress_and_production_readiness_report_2026_10_29_internal_final_invoice_boundary", "label": "Internal final-invoice boundary", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/MANAGEMENT_PROGRESS_AND_PRODUCTION_READINESS_REPORT_2026-10-29.md", "source_location": "L107", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "**Application work ends at final invoice creation and printing.** Payment collection, refunds, credit balances, receipts and later financial handling are outside the current application scope. ### 2.3 Important changes in direction"}, {"id": "docs_management_progress_and_production_readiness_report_2026_10_29_versioned_recurring_excel_formats", "label": "Versioned recurring Excel formats", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/MANAGEMENT_PROGRESS_AND_PRODUCTION_READINESS_REPORT_2026-10-29.md", "source_location": "L58", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "| Repeated customer files | Introduced versioned customer-specific Excel formats covering an inventory of 24 supplied workbooks | Staff can reuse an approved format instead of starting the interpretation process again for every file | | Purchasing | Clarified requested quantities, buffers, targets, actual purchases, substitutions and shortages | Buyers and packing staff work from the same meaning of the order | | Packing | Improved planning rules, configuration review, item adjustments, finalization and record locking | Helps staff complete packing without unnecessary approval steps while preserving the final record | | Product setup | Rework"}, {"id": "docs_management_progress_and_production_readiness_report_2026_10_29_procurement_handoff_atomicity", "label": "Procurement handoff atomicity", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/MANAGEMENT_PROGRESS_AND_PRODUCTION_READINESS_REPORT_2026-10-29.md", "source_location": "L303", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "### 6.4 One confirmation saves purchases and sends them to packing Purchase confirmation validates the purchase information and creates Handoff 01 in the same transaction."}, {"id": "docs_management_progress_and_production_readiness_report_2026_10_29_packing_finalization_atomicity", "label": "Packing finalization atomicity", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/MANAGEMENT_PROGRESS_AND_PRODUCTION_READINESS_REPORT_2026-10-29.md", "source_location": "L493", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "### 8.5 Current finalization behaviour The current operator workflow no longer asks staff to enter a separate manual net/gross scale reading for every box."}, {"id": "docs_management_progress_and_production_readiness_report_2026_10_29_durable_retry_outcomes", "label": "Durable retry outcomes", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/MANAGEMENT_PROGRESS_AND_PRODUCTION_READINESS_REPORT_2026-10-29.md", "source_location": "L815", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "**Change:** Covered operations use a durable request key and a saved outcome. Repeating the same key and same request returns the saved result. Reusing the key with changed details conflicts rather than silently performing different work. The browser retains pending intent information for explicit recovery. A new intentional request is separate from recovery of the old one."}, {"id": "docs_management_progress_and_production_readiness_report_2026_10_29_optimistic_revision_checks", "label": "Optimistic revision checks", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/MANAGEMENT_PROGRESS_AND_PRODUCTION_READINESS_REPORT_2026-10-29.md", "source_location": "L799", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "### 12.5 R4: Protect against stale screens overwriting newer work **Previous risk:** Two people or browser tabs could edit the same shipment or invoice. An older form could overwrite newer information."}, {"id": "docs_management_progress_and_production_readiness_report_2026_10_29_private_source_recovery", "label": "Private source recovery", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/MANAGEMENT_PROGRESS_AND_PRODUCTION_READINESS_REPORT_2026-10-29.md", "source_location": "L823", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "### 12.7 R6: Protect original documents and prepare for recovery The implementation includes:"}, {"id": "docs_management_progress_and_production_readiness_report_2026_10_29_bounded_processing_and_reads", "label": "Bounded processing and reads", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/MANAGEMENT_PROGRESS_AND_PRODUCTION_READINESS_REPORT_2026-10-29.md", "source_location": "L842", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "### 12.8 R7: Bound expensive work and long waits The work adds limits around uploads, workbook structure, parsing, packing calculations, request bodies, database waits and browser fetches."}, {"id": "docs_management_progress_and_production_readiness_report_2026_10_29_hosted_upgrade_with_preservation", "label": "Hosted upgrade with preservation", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/MANAGEMENT_PROGRESS_AND_PRODUCTION_READINESS_REPORT_2026-10-29.md", "source_location": "L897", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "### 13.1 Completed hosted upgrade On 28 October 2026, the configured hosted database was upgraded from `20261025_0015` to `20261027_0024` through nine pending Alembic migrations."}, {"id": "docs_management_progress_and_production_readiness_report_2026_10_29_pending_production_acceptance", "label": "Pending production acceptance", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/MANAGEMENT_PROGRESS_AND_PRODUCTION_READINESS_REPORT_2026-10-29.md", "source_location": "L1140", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "### 17.2 Complete the matching application release The hosted database being on 0024 does not prove that the matching web and API release is deployed. The release should identify the exact frontend, backend, migration and configuration versions together."}, {"id": "docs_management_progress_and_production_readiness_report_2026_10_29_reviewed_operating_data", "label": "Reviewed operating data", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/MANAGEMENT_PROGRESS_AND_PRODUCTION_READINESS_REPORT_2026-10-29.md", "source_location": "L1146", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "### 17.3 Complete product and business-data approval Remaining work includes:"}, {"id": "docs_management_progress_and_production_readiness_report_2026_10_29_guided_staff_workspaces", "label": "Guided staff workspaces", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/MANAGEMENT_PROGRESS_AND_PRODUCTION_READINESS_REPORT_2026-10-29.md", "source_location": "L732", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "### 11.8 Next-step guidance is useful without taking over the page The guidance work includes:"}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_management_progress_and_production_readiness_report_2026_10_29_document", "target": "docs_management_progress_and_production_readiness_report_2026_10_29_implemented_verified_released_distinction", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/MANAGEMENT_PROGRESS_AND_PRODUCTION_READINESS_REPORT_2026-10-29.md", "source_location": "L13", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_management_progress_and_production_readiness_report_2026_10_29_document", "target": "docs_management_progress_and_production_readiness_report_2026_10_29_internal_final_invoice_boundary", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/MANAGEMENT_PROGRESS_AND_PRODUCTION_READINESS_REPORT_2026-10-29.md", "source_location": "L107", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_management_progress_and_production_readiness_report_2026_10_29_document", "target": "docs_management_progress_and_production_readiness_report_2026_10_29_versioned_recurring_excel_formats", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/MANAGEMENT_PROGRESS_AND_PRODUCTION_READINESS_REPORT_2026-10-29.md", "source_location": "L58", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_management_progress_and_production_readiness_report_2026_10_29_document", "target": "docs_management_progress_and_production_readiness_report_2026_10_29_procurement_handoff_atomicity", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/MANAGEMENT_PROGRESS_AND_PRODUCTION_READINESS_REPORT_2026-10-29.md", "source_loca